  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Soft Bouquet.png|left|200px|Soft bouquet]]\n\n{{Infobox\n |title = [[Products|Product]]\n |level = 93\n |price = 1 to 298\n |time = 30 min\n |source = {{Infoicon|flowers|bigger|link=Flower Shop}}\n |xp = 36\n |base = 83\n |dia = 3\n |time3 = 25 min\n}}\n'''Soft bouquets''' are [[products]] unlocked at [[experience]] level 93.\n\nLike all [[products]], they are stored in the [[barn]].\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Making soft bouquets'''===\n[[File:Flower Shop.png|150px|left|Flower Shop]]\nSoft bouquets are made in the [[Flower Shop]].\n\nTo make a bouquet, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"4\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: .5em 0;\"\n|-\n|[[File:Peony.png|75px|Peonies|link=Peony]]\n|[[File:Cotton.png|75px|Cotton|link=Cotton]]\n|[[File:Cotton Fabric.png|75px|Cotton fabric|link=Cotton Fabric]]\n|-\n|'''x4'''\n|'''x1'''\n|'''x1'''\n|}\nIt takes 30 minutes to make a soft bouquet, and 25 minutes in a fully [[Masteries|mastered]] shop. Each bouquet gives players 36 [[experience]] points.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Selling soft bouquets'''===\n[[File:Roadside Shop.png|150px|left|Roadside shop]]\n* Soft bouquets can be bought or sold for a maximum price of 2,988 {{Infoicon|Coin}} for 10 units.\n* Buying the ingredients required to make a soft bouquet costs 280 {{Infoicon|Coin}} coins.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Boat orders'''===\n[[File:Riverboat.png|150px|left|Riverboat]]\n* [[Boat]] orders ask for 1 to 2 soft bouquets per crate, up to a total of 8 per boat.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n\n{{Navigation}}\n{{Languages\n|de = Zarter Strauß\n|es = Ramo delicado\n|fr = Bouquet Doux\n|it = Bouquet delicato\n|nl = Zomers Boeket\n|no = Myk bukett\n|ru = Нежный букет\n|zh = Soft Bouquet\n}}\n[[pt-br:Buquê delicado]]\n\n[[Category:Flower Shop Products]]\n[[Category:Cotton Products]]\n[[Category:Cotton Fabric Products]]\n[[Category:Peony Products]]",
